# Variadic function called with zero extra args: xs collects into an empty Seq (nil sentinel Dict({})).
# This is the zero-variadic-args case: no positional args are supplied.
# The nil sentinel is Value::Dict({}) — the standard end-of-Seq marker.
[f: [fn [...xs] xs]
 result: [f]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(xs), "result": Dict({})})
